{"id":55162,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55162"},"modified":"2026-09-02T16:03:15","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T15:03:15","slug":"corrida-da-agua","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-da-agua\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida da \u00c1gua 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida da \u00c1gua 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 14.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Corrida da \u00c1gua 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, proporcionando uma experi\u00eancia memor\u00e1vel de atletismo no pulm\u00e3o verde de <strong>Monsanto<\/strong> e a travessia exclusiva pelo hist\u00f3rico <strong>Aqueduto das \u00c1guas Livres<\/strong>, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pela Xistarca em parceria com a EPAL e a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa, a prova celebra a import\u00e2ncia da \u00e1gua e do patrim\u00f3nio monumental da capital.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa divide-se entre a competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 10h15 na Estrada da Serafina) e a acess\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong> (com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h30 no Parque do Calhau). Ambos os percursos partilham a passagem privilegiada pela arcada do Aqueduto e concluem a festa desportiva com a consagra\u00e7\u00e3o e meta no Parque do Calhau.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo) \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(